#. module: ai_helpdesk
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_helpdesk.ai_prompt_top_ticket_cause
msgid ""
"Search for helpdesk tickets (model_name: helpdesk.ticket), retrieve the most "
"recent 5 tickets and summarize what they complain about (field_name: "
"description).\n"
"Include the ticket name (field_name: name) in the response. Don't mention "
"model_name or field_name or any record ids in the response."
msgstr ""
"Suche nach Kundendiensttickets (Modellname: helpdesk.ticket), rufe die "
"letzten 5 Tickets ab und fasse die Beschwerden zusammen (Feldname: "
"description).\n"
"Gib den Ticketnamen (Feldname: name) in der Antwort an. Erwähne in der "
"Antwort weder den Modellnamen noch den Feldnamen noch irgendwelche Datensatz-"
"IDs."

